{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"f94941c2468d0c72d2a05a32133edc03811a2c6abc1ea2a26b4a97827a27cffd","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"7cc5234bfc05f41c90b009168a044d4cc5b60ccdc89092fd764dd4436a80fd60","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"漏译限定词 corrosive。源码 tome 组件 game/modules/tome/data/general/npcs/venom-drake.lua@commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 第48行 desc；同文件第23-43行基础模板 BASE_NPC_VENOM_DRAKE 有 resists={[DamageType.ACID]=100}，第47-58行幼仔条目带 on_melee_hit={[DamageType.ACID]=resolvers.mbonus(7,2)}。corrosive 是该 desc 中唯一提示酸性/腐蚀机制的信息，译文「一只毒龙幼仔」将其整体丢弃，玩家无法从描述得知近战接触会受酸伤。"},{"revision_key":"7cecbd31cdbecc7feca34a7f474435fdcfa673fe30aaccd557873f5af887ae73","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7d06ee596a35dd9c82a40f516a59e8ed401e8435ecf0b6a6205fd670d1cab4b1","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"preserved with magic 误译为「上面充满了魔法的力量」，把「用魔法保存（使其维持鲜活/跳动）」改成「蕴含大量魔力」，事实陈述改变。源码 tome 组件 game/modules/tome/data/zones/last-hope-graveyard/objects.lua@commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 第32-56行 CELIA_HEART：name=\"Celia's Still Beating Heart\"、unided_name=\"bloody heart\"，第45行 desc 即本条；同 commit game/modules/tome/data/zones/last-hope-graveyard/npcs.lua 第115行同场景文本「Carefully weaving magic around it to keep it beating.」明确魔法的作用是保鲜、维持跳动。译文与该跨条设定不一致。"},{"revision_key":"7d30d7a3af3efda2152e5a2674d707c8367201c10deaf0c7595f5b8a3fce6800","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7d338ba656d7f64dc5572ff4c47e043ee7a5e1c12c1ff3eaee5f3a5fcb34240b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"技能树类别名 archery prowess 译作「强化箭」属误译。源码 tome 组件 game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/techniques.lua@commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 第33行：type=\"technique/archery-utility\", name=_t(\"archery prowess\",\"talent type\"), description=_t\"Specialized archery techniques to maim your targets.\"。同 commit game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/archery.lua 第418、493、583、666 行显示该树成员为 Headshot、Volley、Called Shots、Bullseye，均为射术技巧而非「强化箭矢」。prowess 意为射术精通/造诣，「强化箭」既非该词义，也与同组第30-34行的 archery - bows／archery training／archery excellence 等同系列类别名构成的命名体系脱节。"},{"revision_key":"7d4501a3e0fdefe060a7770e7aeb319b14860fcdc567cdce4a3d1f3cbcf2fdee","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7d479a3c53559779c6f59598e76d7138ed41090998bfc8bb8e700fdd895f8000","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7d74a16beefdcae13b9a7e43ce0e9bc5fba7ccb2de6349853494d73994e1c8e4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"NPC 名 Pushy elf 译作「爱出风头的精灵」，语义与机制均不符。源码 tome 组件 game/modules/tome/data/zones/tutorial-combat-stats/npcs.lua@commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 第329-344行 define_as=\"PUSHY_ELF\"，其唯一天赋为 resolvers.talents{[Talents.T_TUTORIAL_SPELL_KB]}；同 commit game/modules/tome/data/talents/misc/tutorial.lua 第49-69行该天赋为 name=\"Mana Gale\", short_name=\"TUTORIAL_SPELL_KB\"，action 中调用 target:knockback(...) 并输出「is knocked back by the gale」。Pushy 指其把玩家推开（击退），教程用于演示 physical resist 抗击退；「爱出风头」表示好表现自己，与击退无关，且同段第346-375行 Blustering elf／Breezy elf 同为击退演示，该译名破坏这组命名的机制含义。"},{"revision_key":"7d7635025dc042204d0cbbdbe62fff36aff6342292b86ae1db678f02d1c0431c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7d98ebce7bbbd509b3b7a37ad2a4552f52741945b089ca8366474e6881e460a4","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7dc3b66389cbcaf3d50d474f41a1868264ea47a3474a03592cccbcba6532b8ac","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"状态名 Hurricane（飓风）译作「风暴之怒」，既添加原文没有的「怒」，又占用「风暴」一词。源码 tome 组件 game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/magical.lua@commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 第1159-1168行：name=\"HURRICANE\"、desc=_t\"Hurricane\"，long_desc 第1162行称目标处于 a lightning hurricane 中心并每回合对周围造成闪电伤害，on_gain/on_lose（第1167-1168行）文本亦为 \"#Target# is caught inside a Hurricane.\"／\"The Hurricane around #Target# dissipates.\"，同一状态多处以 Hurricane 指代。该状态由同 commit game/modules/tome/data/talents/spells/storm.lua 第104行天赋 name=\"Hurricane\"（第126行 setEffect(target.EFF_HURRICANE,...)）施加，而同一 storm 树第149行另有独立天赋 name=\"Tempest\"（风暴），把 Hurricane 译成「风暴之怒」会与同树 Tempest 的自然译法争用同一词根，削弱状态与天赋的对应关系。"},{"revision_key":"7dcc79491f079b0a59cb006f963845930eddc13fdbb472cd2330a80d2c035b52","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7dd1f2846be880215168e38a089b2364a7f0091c53412c8c62a639e9137b69f1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7dda74067517204b1a057eac2dab1b2fb0a2add41b6df7bf293c51784e1f197a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7de09131958e79e0896f5bfdc14deccba941abb6fdb716961ad4bc8be6aa90c6","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7de379f6f27d5c3362178a11bbc345bfe0b453e0fb484f3ae8cf60678479850c","verdict":"OK"}]}